// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P776529962" "Silence!  I cannot stand to listen to your ridiculous prattle any longer!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P726782956" "You are a blemish on all things magical!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1271558035" "Silence!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P335326910" "Sir, I will not remind you again.  If this should escalate to violence, so be it!  You have been warned!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3386011080" "Well then!  To arms!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2208210721" "You will feel my blade!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2353807632" "Let us begin!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_GUARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2735493021" "To arms!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_LEGACYCHAINCOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3605526371" "You have corrupted all that is good and true!  You will perish!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_LEGACYCHAINCOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P837509075" "You have desecrated all that is good and true!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_LEGACYCHAINCOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P129747854" "You will perish!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_LEGACYCHAINCOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3361184206" "You are a corrupter of the magics!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_LEGACYCHAINCOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4045332532" "You are a disgrace!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1621663142" "Yes, thank you.  It is a pleasure and an honour to be here, as well."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2719798134" "If there is any other form of assistance you require, do let us know.  The Legacy Chain is at your disposal."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1177442591" "You are too kind.  I am honoured to lend my assistance."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P847598230" "Yes.   The threat of the Circle of Thorns is deeper than at first thought.  More than you may realize is at stake here."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1367531032" "I wish I could relate all of my information on our aims here in The Hollows, but some of it is of the utmost secret within our ranks.  My apologies."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2382291667" "Hush!  I detect footsteps."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P675540334" "Hush.  I think someone is coming."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P384603486" "Shh.  We're not alone."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_LEGACYTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3172103500" "This remains between you and I."

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4272742523" "Halt!  In the name of Legacy Chain!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P952330753" "You there!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1940552146" "Ho there!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P98570329" "Declare yourself!"

// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3723081253" "Ah yes, it is an interesting question.  Their presence here is a conundrum.  We must be ever vigilant."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4271726759" "The Circle of Thorns walk Eastgate as easily as we do.  We must keep our eyes alert for them."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3798216137" "Sir, the question is not why are we now here in The Hollows, the question is why did we wait this long, knowing what we know now?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_GUARD_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2698507862" "Senses keen, gentlemen!  You know the nefarious schemes of the Thorns' use of souls and the power within those crystals!"


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1163165842" "I do not mind it here, really.  Atlas Park is just next door and you can buy a simply delightful concoction there called a 'taco', if you wish!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P894603752" "Our aims are twofold, monitor the magical misuse within the Hollows by the Circle of Thorns and...the other."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P833874635" "They need not know our secondary aims at this time.  The threat is building.  Our duty is to the cause, not crying to Longbow for permission."
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P746235111" "I, too, noticed them near the water.  What do you think their purpose is here?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3791226659" "An interesting and formidable foe to be sure.  We'll still need to obliterate them, of course."


// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P518325447" "Gentlemen, everyone has their assignments!  Is there anyone who is not clear?"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1758635264" "We're all aware of our assignments!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886202937" "We are pledged to maintain a true and good standard!  Those who seek to destroy that which is good will perish at our sword!"
// HOLLOWS_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1207494393" "You know what you need to do!"



